    {
      "id": 338438,
      "name": "Red (Dragon Quest VIII)",
      "description": "<p>Red from Dragon Quest VIII (PS2 &amp; Nintendo 3DS), is a supporting character originally, made playable in the 3DS port. I was surprised there was no Lora of her yet, despite Dragon Quest being such a big name and other supporting characters had a Lora made out of them already.</p><p>Red is and Yangus have history together, and she makes Yangus fetch a rare treasure for her, which he had apparently promised for her in the past.</p><p>Usage notes for different versions:</p><pre><code>Anima: Works on strength 1. Updated dataset and improved tagging. The only iffy part is the sheathed knife on her belt, as with plain \"sheath\" prompt it can generate as a full-sized sword sheath, and \"knife sheath\" can instead generate the sheath somewhere else on her body.</code></pre><pre><code>Illustrious: Works on strength 1. The single strap is not 100% accurate and may thus require multiple generations attempts or inpainting.</code></pre><pre><code>SD 1.5: Works well with 0.5 - 0.6 strength. Tested on anime-like models.</code></pre><p>Hope you like the lora! :)</p>",
